  "description": "Set up for trail riding perfection on the long-travel Voltage 900 Tuned e-MTB. With 160mm front and 155mm tunable rear travel combined with the boosted torque of TQ’s new HPR60 motor unit, you’ll be brappin’ and slappin’ as you push your rides to all-new heights.\n\nLet’s talk about the new HPR60. Updated from the HPR50 found on the previous Voltage, HPR60 dishes out 60Nm of hair-raising torque for you to gobble up inclines like your post-ride burritos. It’s a 20% boost in performance that makes the Voltage 900 ride at the top of its class in the lightweight e-bike category.\n\nRange has improved, too. Each Voltage comes with a Range Extender Battery to complement the 360Wh main battery to keep the lights on longer—so to speak—and make your rides damn near indefatigable. Not sure where your ride will go? Take it along with you for just-in-case moments. It’s the size of a small water bottle and stows away in your day pack.\n\nOur NUDE Suspension technology with the Float-X NUDE shock from FOX paired with a fork that favors more adjustability. When you pedal up to have the most fun on the way down, you want a shock that gives you full factory performance when things point downwards, but also a shock that won’t slow you down when you need to ride back up. This is where the Float-X NUDE shines.\n\nThis Voltage also comes with SRAM’s GX Eagle AXS Transmission groupset and powerful Maven four-piston brakes to give you the range and the stopping power to make every ride one to remember.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
